      "uid": "01a0d15c28c6-e4460cfb07",
      "label": "复盘 F6/F12 desync 实例（commit 证据）",
      "status": "completed",
      "mode": "explore",
      "parent": "1-1",
      "children": [],
      "decisions": [
        {
          "q": "Q: F6/F12 desync 的 commit 证据？",
          "answer": "1-2-1(F6)/1-2-2(F12) 的 status 在 aa05286（1-2-5 的 chore(roadmap)）之前已是 completed（首次出现于更早的打包提交），但其实现代码直到 677d18c（feat(ui): 1-2-1 F6 + 1-2-2 F12）才提交并推送——存在 status 先于代码的时间窗。其余 22 个 completed 节点均为 feat 先于 chore(roadmap)（如 1-2-3: 66b7364→061ed59；1-2-4: 3600aa9→2a40677；1-2-5: 3c015c4→aa05286；1-3: 01592bb→63d3e22），无时间窗。",
          "note": ""
        }
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "layer": "plan"
    },
    "1-1-2": {
      "id": "1-1-2",
      "uid": "01a0d15c29e0-eae084a2cb",
      "label": "定义 desync 判定规则（feat 先于 chore(roadmap)）",
      "status": "completed",
      "mode": "explore",
      "parent": "1-1",
      "children": [],
      "decisions": [
        {
          "q": "Q: desync 判定规则如何定义？",
          "answer": "desync = 路线图某节点 status==completed，但其对应实现代码（src/ 改动 + 含节点 id 或 F-number 的 feat commit）晚于 status 翻转提交才落地。等价于违反「feat 先于 chore(roadmap)」约定。判定以 git 历史时序为准，不靠人工记忆。",
          "note": ""
        }
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "layer": "plan"
    },
